<title>USA: HCC Insurance names Frank Bramanti president.</title>
<headline>HCC Insurance names Frank Bramanti president.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>HCC Insurance Holdings Inc said Monday that Frank Bramanti was promoted to president of the company and Peter Smith was promoted to executive vice president and the newly created position of chief operating officer.</p>
<p>The former president was Steve Lockwood, who was given the title of vice chairman.</p>
<p>Bramanti's former position was executive vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Bramanti said the company expects to name a new CFO &quot;shortly.&quot;</p>
</text>
